     : ProjectionExec: expr=[id@2 as col_1, id@5 as col_2, pdb.score(j)@0 + pdb.score(c)@3 as col_3, ctid_0@1 as ctid_0, ctid_1@4 as ctid_1]
     :   GlobalLimitExec: skip=0, fetch=10
     :     VisibilityFilterExec: tables=[j, c]
     :       RankJoinExec: mode=CollectLeft, on=[(id@2, client_id@2)], order=[pdb.score(j)@0 + pdb.score(c)@3 DESC, id@2 ASC NULLS LAST], projection=[pdb.score(j)@3, ctid_0@4, id@6, pdb.score(c)@0, ctid_1@1, id@2]
     :         CooperativeExec
     :           PgSearchScan: table=c, segments=1, lazy_sort=20, dynamic_filters=1, query={"const_score":{"query":{"term_set":{"terms":[{"field":"division","value":1}]}},"score":0.0}}, disjunct={"with_index":{"query":{"parse_with_field":{"field":"name","query_string":"zebra","lenient":null,"conjunction_mode":null}}}}
     :         CooperativeExec
     :           PgSearchScan: table=j, segments=1, lazy_sort=20, dynamic_filters=1, query={"const_score":{"query":{"term_set":{"terms":[{"field":"division","value":1}]}},"score":0.0}}, disjunct={"with_index":{"query":{"parse_with_field":{"field":"body","query_string":"zebra","lenient":null,"conjunction_mode":null}}}}
